.TH "SMLAB" "1" "Aug 22, 2026" "0.0.0" "smlab"
.SH NAME
smlab \- smlab v0.0.0
.SH COMMAND REFERENCE
.SS smlab
.sp
Generate StepMania dance\-single charts from audio.
.sp
Usage
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
smlab [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Options
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-d, \-\-debug
Enable verbose output.
.UNINDENT
.SS analyze
.sp
Report timing and physical demands of an existing simfile.
.sp
Usage
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
smlab analyze [OPTIONS] SIMFILE
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Arguments
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B SIMFILE
Required argument
.UNINDENT
.SS envelopes
.sp
Build the banded onset envelopes the offset model trains on.
.sp
Usage
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
smlab envelopes [OPTIONS]
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Options
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-m, \-\-manifest <manifest>
Manifest to read.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-o, \-\-output <output>
Cache directory to fill.
.UNINDENT
.SS generate
.sp
Generate a song folder holding a simfile and a copy of the audio.
.sp
Usage
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
smlab generate [OPTIONS] AUDIO
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Options
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-o, \-\-output\-dir <output_dir>
Directory the song folder is created inside, usually a pack.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-T, \-\-title <title>
Song title, which also names the song folder.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-A, \-\-artist <artist>
Song artist.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-S, \-\-subtitle <subtitle>
Song subtitle.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-G, \-\-genre <genre>
Song genre.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-C, \-\-credit <credit>
Chart author. Defaults to the current user.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-title\-translit <title_translit>
Romanised title.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-subtitle\-translit <subtitle_translit>
Romanised subtitle.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-artist\-translit <artist_translit>
Romanised artist.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-banner <banner>
Banner image file name.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-background <background>
Background image file name.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-cdtitle <cdtitle>
Mix logo file name.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-sample\-start <sample_start>
Preview start in seconds. Detected when omitted.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-sample\-length <sample_length>
Preview length in seconds.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-D, \-\-difficulty <difficulty>
Difficulty to generate, as NAME or NAME:RATING. Repeat for several.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-m, \-\-meter <meter>
Rating for every difficulty that does not carry its own. Zero uses the defaults.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-s, \-\-style <style>
Physical constraints to respect.
.INDENT 7.0
.TP
.B Options
feet | hands | keyboard
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-bpm <bpm>
Override the detected tempo.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-bpm\-multiplier <bpm_multiplier>
Scale the tempo. Use 2 when detection halved it, or 0.5 when it doubled it.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-offset <offset>
Override the detected offset.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-shift\-beats <shift_beats>
Move beat 0 later by this many beats. Use 0.5 when the grid locked onto the off\-beat.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-latency <latency>
Seconds of constant playback latency to compensate, applied to every chart. Also settable as SMLAB_LATENCY.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-i, \-\-image, \-\-no\-image
Also draw each chart as a picture next to the simfile.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-svg, \-\-png
Draw charts as SVG instead of PNG.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-f, \-\-format <fmt>
Simfile format to write.
.INDENT 7.0
.TP
.B Default
\fB\(aqssc\(aq\fP
.TP
.B Options
dwi | sm | ssc
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-balance <balance>
How hard to pull the four panels towards equal use. Zero leaves the model alone, which leans heavily on the middle two.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-crossovers <crossovers>
Share of streamed notes that may land on a crossed foot. Omit for the measured default, or pass 0 to bar crossovers entirely. A sixteenth stream is held to a fraction of whatever applies.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-triplets, \-\-no\-triplets
Also place notes on the twelfth grid. Off by default; 74%% of charts never do.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-mines, \-\-no\-mines
Allow mines. Off by default.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-rolls, \-\-no\-rolls
Allow roll notes. Off by default; 98 per cent of real charts have none.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-holds <holds>
Largest share of notes that may be freezes. Real charts sit near 0.04.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-density <density>
Multiplier on how many steps to place.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-temperature <temperature>
Sampling temperature for patterns.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-scale <scale>
Rating scale the ratings are on. Classic DDR 10, In The Groove 15, X\-era DDR 20.
.INDENT 7.0
.TP
.B Options
10 | 15 | 20
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-nps <nps>
Aim for this note rate instead of the one the rating implies. Zero uses the rating.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-seed <seed>
Seed for sampling.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-weights\-repo <weights_repo>
Repository to download weights from. Also settable as SMLAB_WEIGHTS_REPO.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-weights\-revision <weights_revision>
Pin the weights to a revision. Also settable as SMLAB_WEIGHTS_REVISION.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-c, \-\-checkpoints <checkpoints>
Directory of locally trained checkpoints. Uses the bundled models when omitted.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-vocabulary <vocabulary>
Pattern vocabulary to use. Uses the bundled one when omitted.
.UNINDENT
.sp
Arguments
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B AUDIO
Required argument
.UNINDENT
.SS image
