Directory to write into. Defaults to .images/ beside the simfile.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-svg, \-\-png
Draw as SVG instead of PNG.
.UNINDENT
.sp
Arguments
.INDENT 0.0
