.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-r, \-\-repository <repository>
Repository to upload to. Defaults to tatsh/smlab.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-n, \-\-dry\-run
List what would be uploaded and stop.
.UNINDENT
